Hydra-GTK

Gtk+2 frontend for thc-hydra



To install just do a:

./configure
 make
 su root
 make install

Easy at it can be... You need thc-hydra installed to make this work.
This is my second gtk+2 program, so I am waiting for a lot of patches :)
